        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>When faced with danger, your nanites can envelop your body in a shimmering metallic armor. You gain the effects of a 5th-rank @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Elemental Form] spell, except that you must choose either metal or water as your element, and you gain weakness 10 to electricity while the effect is active. At 14th level, you gain the effects of a 6th-rank <em>elemental form</em> spell, and at 18th level, you gain the effects of a 7th-rank <em>elemental form</em> spell.</p>"
